                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51 W 89 Lithuania/6: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Young</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-01T17:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 1—3:35
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>193. Department’s instruction 271, August 8th. Notes to three governments
                    presented today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
